# Borghertz's Warring Hands (jeuno 44): canStartQuest's operands one at a time, and 155's Option. Main: a level 50
# Warrior, The Talekeeper's Truth available: Guslam: nil (his default 154). The prerequisite completed (a GM),
# Borghertz's Striking Hands accepted (a GM): the Warring Hands nil; the Striking Hands' accepted section answers 43. Striking Hands available again: 155 (Option 1); the Option set to 2
# by a GM while 155 is open: finished: Option 2 is not WAR (1): not begun; 155 again (Option 1): begun. Bob: a level 49
# Warrior with the prerequisite: 154. Cid: a level 50 Monk with the Warrior's prerequisite (The First Meeting
# available): every Borghertz quest silent: 154. Dan: a level 50 Monk with the Striking Hands' prerequisite (The First
# Meeting) completed and the Warring Hands accepted (canStartQuest's loop entry 0): the Striking Hands silent; the
# Warring Hands' accepted section answers 43.
lists UpperJeuno/Guslam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/155
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-4.2,1.3,47.5 job=WAR lvl=50
char bob zone=UpperJeuno pos=-4.2,1.3,46 job=WAR lvl=49
char cid zone=UpperJeuno pos=-5.5,1.3,47.5 job=MNK lvl=50
char dan zone=UpperJeuno pos=-5.5,1.3,46 job=MNK lvl=50
bob: quest Bastok.TheTalekeepersTruth completed
cid: quest Bastok.TheTalekeepersTruth completed
dan: quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting completed
dan: quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWarringHands accepted
login
bob: login
cid: login
dan: login
trigger Guslam                          # the prerequisite available: nil; 154
finish
quest Bastok.TheTalekeepersTruth completed # a GM
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsStrikingHands accepted # a GM
trigger Guslam                          # another Borghertz quest accepted: nil; the Striking Hands' 43
finish
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsStrikingHands available # a GM
trigger Guslam                          # 155 (Option 1)
charvar Quest[3][44]Option 2            # a GM, while 155 is open
finish                                  # Option 2 is not the main job: not begun
trigger Guslam                          # 155 (Option 1)
finish                                  # begun
bob: trigger Guslam                     # level 49: 154
bob: finish
cid: trigger Guslam                     # a Monk: the WAR quest not; the MNK quest's prerequisite available: 154
cid: finish
dan: trigger Guslam                     # the Warring Hands accepted: the Striking Hands nil; the Warring Hands' 43
dan: finish
